# The needler, held on a target three units away that stands still: the rate of
# fire comes up from 3 a second to 10, each needle that hits sticks to the target
# and explodes after its time (10 damage to it), and seven or more stuck to one
# target explode together in a blast (a damage that falls with the distance). The
# rounds, the reload of an empty magazine and the target's shield and health are
# the engine's to the last bit.
scenario needler_burst
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 81.0 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/needler/needler
ticks 420
# aim at the body
input 0 420 pitch=-0.13
input 60 130 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
